    "sentence_translations": [
      "In One Ear And Out The Other",
      "",
      "Lili: Where are you?",
      "",
      "Little He: I’m working overtime.",
      "",
      "Lili: Didn’t I tell you yesterday that we are going to eat together with my mom and dad today?",
      "",
      "Little He: Huh? Did you say that?",
      "",
      "Lili: I did. And I said it three times!",
      "",
      "Little He: I don’t remember you saying that.",
      "",
      "Lili: You’re always like this! Everything I tell you just goes in one ear and out the other.",
      "",
      "Little He: That’s not true!",
      "",
      "Lili: It’s true! My mom and dad are already waiting, what should we do?",
      "",
      "Little He: Relax. I’ll come over right now.",
      ""
